  "notes": "Trench S1 split into three segments (83.33 m, 33.33 m, 33.33 m) to satisfy sequential cutting, compaction after survey, and to provide 20 m3 of spoil for earth bridge before segment 2 excavation. Earth bridge S2 built from trench spoil (20 m3 hauled, 40 m2 compacted). Constraint: earth bridge completed before segment 2 excavation (T4 after T11). Single-robot-per-zone enforced by sequential after dependencies in Z1 (T1->T2->T3->T4->T5->T6->T7->T8->T9) and Z2 (T10->T11). Haul T10 now waits for excavation T1 that supplies its 20 m3. All tasks fit within robot batteries and 120 h horizon."
